es in my hand, (2) It conflicts with pursuing Half Flush (honor tiles + one suit), (3) The previous player already has a B5 pung exposed, making B4 relatively safe from being useful to them, (4) Keeping the W3-W4-W5-W6 cluster maintains maximum flexibility for forming multiple chows in Characters suit, which is my strongest suit concentration.\n\nAnswer: Play B4"}
